#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrieveAuto), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:34
#, kde-format
msgid "Enable Automatic Free/Busy Retrieval"
msgstr "Omogući automatsko dohvaćanje dostupnosti"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyFullDomainRetrieval), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:38
#, kde-format
msgid "Use full email address for retrieval"
msgstr "Za dohvaćanje upotrijebi cijelu adresu e-pošte"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FreeBusyFullDomainRetrieval), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this setting, you can change the filename that will be fetched from the "
"server. With this checked, it will download a free/busy file called "
"user@domain.ifb, for example nn@kde.org.ifb. Without this set, it will "
"download user.ifb, for example nn.ifb."
msgstr ""
"Ovom postavkom možete promijeniti naziv datoteke koja će se preuzeti s "
"poslužitelja. Ako je ova opcija uključena, preuzet će se datoteka dostupnosti "
"naziva user@domena.ifb, primjerice nn@kde.org.ifb. Ako nije uključena, "
"preuzet će se user.ifb, primjerice nn.ifb."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrieveUrl), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:43
#, kde-format
msgid "Free/Busy Retrieval URL"
msgstr "URL za dohvaćanje dostupnosti"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrieveUser), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:46
#, kde-format
msgid "Free/Busy Retrieval Username"
msgstr "Korisničko ime za dohvaćanje dostupnosti"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrievePassword), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:49
#, kde-format
msgid "Free/Busy Retrieval Password"
msgstr "Lozinka za dohvaćanje dostupnosti"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FreeBusyRetrievePassword), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Password for retrieving free/busy information"
msgstr "Lozinka za dohvaćanje podataka o dostupnosti"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:59
#, kde-format
msgid "Send copy to owner when mailing events"
msgstr "Pošalji kopiju vlasniku pri slanju e-pošte o događajima"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:60
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to get a copy of all e-mail messages that KOrganizer sends at "
"your request to event attendees."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovu kućicu da biste primili kopiju svih poruka e-pošte koje "
"KOrganizer na vaš zahtjev šalje sudionicima događaja."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (HideDeclinedInvitations), group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:64
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide declined invitations"
msgstr "Sakrij odbijene pozivnice"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (HideDeclinedInvitations), group (Group Scheduling)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:65
#, kde-format
msgid "Check this box to hide declined invitations in event views."
msgstr "Označite ovu kućicu da biste sakrili odbijene pozivnice u prikazima događaja."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Reminders)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:71
#, kde-format
msgid "Only show reminders for events I organize or attend"
msgstr "Prikazuj podsjetnike samo za događaje koje organiziram ili kojima prisustvujem"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Reminders)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:72
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this to only receive reminders for events that you are the organizer "
"of or that you are attending."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovu kućicu da biste primali podsjetnike samo za događaje koje "
"organizirate ili kojima prisustvujete."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (OutlookCompatCounterProposals), group (Hidden Options)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:79
#, kde-format
msgid "Send Outlook-like pseudo counter proposals"
msgstr "Šalji lažne protuprijedloge u stilu Outlooka"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyCheckHostname), group (Hidden Options)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:83
#, kde-format
msgid "Check whether hostname and retrieval email address match"
msgstr "Provjeri podudaraju li se naziv hosta i adresa e-pošte za dohvaćanje"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FreeBusyCheckHostname), group (Hidden Options)
#: calendarsettings.kcfg:84
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this setting you can configure whether the domain part of the free/busy "
"URL has to match the domain part of the user ID you are looking for. For "
"example, if this option is set, then looking for the free/busy data of "
"joe@mydomain.com on the server www.yourdomain.com will fail."
msgstr ""
"Ovom postavkom možete odrediti mora li se domena URL-a dostupnosti podudarati "
"s domenom traženog korisničkog ID-a. Primjerice, ako je ova opcija uključena, "
"traženje podataka o dostupnosti za joe@mydomain.com na poslužitelju "
"www.yourdomain.com neće uspjeti."

